ue=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applyBonus(scores, multiplier);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>(</code> followed by <code>scores</code> and then <code>,</code>, <code>multiplier</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
